    {
      "bbox": [
        139,
        1086,
        1943,
        1397
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Executive Order #24 dated November 27, 1962 outlines procedures for acquiring office space for use by established city agencies, and remains in effect as do all other Executive Orders not superseded or otherwise modified by action of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2607,
          "min": -1.7137
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0017,
          "min": -0.0486
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16225,
        "area_px": 522496,
        "density": 0.03105,
        "chars": 244,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 15.04
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        123,
        1431,
        1943,
        2117
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The acquisition of office space necessary for new functions authorized by the Mayor whether of temporary or permanent duration and not specifically assigned to an established agency requires special handling until such time as they become an integral part of city government. The orderly processing of the office space requirements of these new activities involves many considerations not the least of which are priorities and budgetary limitations, consistent with the most effective use of available city facilities and minimal need for renting more costly private building space.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2726,
          "min": -1.687
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 91,
          "mean": -0.004,
          "min": -0.2819
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 35288,
        "area_px": 1148160,
        "density": 0.03073,
        "chars": 582,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        2151,
        1931,
        2560
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The necessary space requirements therefore may best be provided by channeling all requests for the housing of new functions through Mr. John McMahon of my office who is serving as liaison with the Department of Real Estate in allocating office space during this period of transition and reorganization.",
